# What a copy of this template never keeps: a kind and a path a line, a
# folder ending in a slash.
#
#   template   only the template's own. workbench/scripts/strip-template.sh
#              deletes these from a new copy as its setup starts
#              (workbench/setup/1-see-it.md), with every block of a
#              Markdown file between <!-- template-only --> and
#              <!-- /template-only -->, like README.md's "This template".
#   setup      what a new copy keeps until it's set up. Each step deletes
#              its own as it passes (START-HERE.md).
#
# An update leaves every path here out of the template's diff, reading
# this list from the release it applies (workbench/updating.md), so a copy
# never gets one back.

template  SECURITY.md
template  CHANGELOG.md
template  .superforge/releases/
template  .github/dependabot.yml
template  .superforge/template-only
template  workbench/scripts/strip-template.sh
setup     START-HERE.md
setup     workbench/setup/
setup     source/frontend/components/welcome/
setup     source/frontend/queries/health.ts
